Comment: 0,0:01:08.31,0:01:10.85,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{Opening}
Comment: 0,0:23:00.33,0:23:12.84,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{Ending}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.12,0:00:06.45,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Listen up, Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.45,0:00:09.48,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Summer vacation is our rival!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.48,0:00:11.44,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Our... rival?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.44,0:00:13.78,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,That's right! Summer means...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.78,0:00:14.65,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,The beach!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.65,0:00:15.62,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Bug catching!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.62,0:00:16.87,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Watermelon breaking!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.19,0:00:22.75,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,A ton of things that allow people to ignore the pain in their hearts!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.75,0:00:24.25,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, are you listening, Dobato?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.00,0:00:29.17,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,A letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.17,0:00:32.05,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,That's not a "letter"! It's called a "flyer"!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.82,0:00:35.44,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,What did I tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.44,0:00:39.30,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,All of this is going to make konpeito collecting an even tougher fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.30,0:00:41.60,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Above all, summer festivals are our biggest enemy!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.60,0:00:46.69,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,With their flutes and taiko, vendors and yukata, and especially their Bon dances!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.69,0:00:48.21,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It's so pretty!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.18,0:00:50.48,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Got it, Kobato?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.53,0:00:54.24,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,You get what I'm saying, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.18,0:01:01.29,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not done speaking to you yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.78,0:01:03.66,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'll try my best not to lose to summer festivals,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.98,0:01:07.23,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,and continue to heal people's wounded hearts!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.99,0:02:48.22,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,A summer festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.52,0:02:53.64,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Where did it fly off to?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.44,0:02:55.48,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Are you looking for this?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.50,0:02:57.98,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, that's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.12,0:03:01.05,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.03,0:03:03.01,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Wait just a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.05,0:03:05.14,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Use this first?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.46,0:03:08.08,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Your hands are sopping wet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.38,0:03:12.42,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.93,0:03:15.91,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,That girl, what's she doing...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.74,0:03:18.92,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,That's a flyer for the summer festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.43,0:03:21.97,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,That's right, it's already time for summer festivals, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.97,0:03:23.81,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Have you ever been to this one?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.81,0:03:25.43,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Every year since I was a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.12,0:03:28.71,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,It always has shrine carrying\Nprocessions and vendors and fireworks.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.71,0:03:29.89,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Flower... fire?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.17,0:03:33.98,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.42,0:03:37.45,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,I might not be able to go this year...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.45,0:03:38.98,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,How come?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.56,0:03:42.15,Default,Child 1,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, when we get to the pool, let's race!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.15,0:03:44.40,Default,Child 2,0000,0000,0000,,Okay! I'm totally gonna win!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.11,0:03:48.12,Default,Child 1,0000,0000,0000,,Hey hey, I've kinda learned how to swim!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.12,0:03:49.03,Default,Child 2,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.66,0:03:53.17,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Oh no. I really need to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.17,0:03:54.79,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Today's still a school day for high schools.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.79,0:03:57.45,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yomogi Nursery is on break today.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.18,0:04:02.79,Default,Yukino,0000,0000,0000,,Ow...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.73,0:04:04.68,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Yukino...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.94,0:04:08.39,Default,Yukino,0000,0000,0000,,Nat! Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.68,0:04:13.89,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,You were texting while walking again, weren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.44,0:04:16.46,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Keep messing around and you're going to be late.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.36,0:04:25.25,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.72,0:04:32.73,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.23,0:04:35.45,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.38,0:04:38.50,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,My body feels really heavy...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.05,0:04:43.56,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.56,0:04:44.51,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,No I'm not!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.92,0:04:47.46,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Didn't I just warn you about losing to summer festivals?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.46,0:04:50.51,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Don't you dare move! I'm just getting started!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.16,0:04:59.09,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Dry me off.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.34,0:05:04.48,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,That uniform is from Seinan Girls' Academy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.78,0:05:08.34,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Do you know Nat?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.34,0:05:08.95,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,No I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.71,0:05:14.43,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,It's a large all girl's school. It's\NSayaka and Chitose's alma mater.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.43,0:05:16.46,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Wow, you know a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.46,0:05:19.49,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,It's a high class ladies' school that's not fit for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.49,0:05:22.02,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,He's a bully today too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.02,0:05:24.10,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Even during summer vacation when the nursery's closed,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.10,0:05:27.35,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,he's still bogged down with work and studying.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.69,0:05:30.56,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Anyway, I'm dry now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.56,0:05:31.72,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,You were going to return this, weren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.03,0:05:33.35,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.99,0:05:48.61,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It looks like Nat isn't here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.61,0:05:50.95,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,If you don't hurry up and find her, the sun's gonna set!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.91,0:05:56.36,Default,Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,Officially, this is an announcement from the beginning of second semester.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.36,0:05:59.15,Default,Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,Natsuki Mizuhashi became the\Nrepresentative of the Volunteer Club
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.15,0:06:02.87,Default,Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,and its efforts in creating a more\Nbeautiful community were recognized.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.87,0:06:06.96,Default,Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,At this time, I would like to present her with a certificate of appreciation from the prefecture.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.75,0:05:54.95,Default Alt,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,There she is!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.62,0:06:13.04,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,So Nat's full name is Natsuki Mizuhashi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.04,0:06:15.18,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,The girl who tripped is in the same class too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.00,0:06:18.04,Default,Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,Just because it's summer vacation,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.04,0:06:20.64,Default,Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,it doesn't mean all of you should stay up all night.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.56,0:06:20.64,Default Alt,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,That's right, the girl from this morning...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.00,0:06:22.76,Default,Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,Summer vacation tends to make students lazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.17,0:06:27.02,Default,Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,Make sure your behavior matches the standards expected from you as students of Seinan--
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.14,0:06:30.04,Default,Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,Morikawa! You again!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.38,0:06:32.52,Default,Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,If you don't stop with the cell\Nphone, I'll have to confiscate it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.38,0:06:35.63,Default,Yukino,0000,0000,0000,,S-Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.21,0:06:40.45,Default,Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,All right. Then I'd like to confirm your\Nemergency contacts over summer vacation.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.45,0:06:42.45,Default,Student,0000,0000,0000,,Wow, great shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.45,0:06:44.83,Default,Student,0000,0000,0000,,You really are a natural at it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.83,0:06:46.13,Default,Yukino,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.70,0:06:48.34,Default,Student,0000,0000,0000,,Really! Have more confidence in yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.83,0:06:49.79,Default,Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,...and that's all for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.25,0:06:55.98,Default,Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,Those on duty for pool clean up, please assemble by the pool.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.98,0:06:56.80,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,They're coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.87,0:06:58.66,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.30,0:07:01.35,Default,Student,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, so where are you headed?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.20,0:07:04.99,Default,Student,0000,0000,0000,,Bye bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.26,0:07:06.09,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Excuse me--
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.14,0:07:09.77,Default,Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,Are you a student here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.46,0:07:14.21,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,No I'm not. I'm Kobato Hanato from Yomogi Nursery!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.21,0:07:16.56,Default,Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,Nursery? What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.56,0:07:19.67,Default,Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,You over there! Hurry up and go call an administrator!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.26,0:07:22.17,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Annoying. Kobato, run!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.41,0:07:24.34,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.34,0:07:25.65,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,It's fine, just go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.13,0:07:28.16,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Okay then, I'll do as you say.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.52,0:07:31.14,Default,Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.55,0:07:36.98,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But I need to find Natsuki...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.97,0:07:43.79,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Hold the lens steady.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.79,0:07:45.94,Default,Yukino,0000,0000,0000,,Wow, there's a real difference using the actual thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.28,0:07:49.17,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,You can buy your own soon, can't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.50,0:07:54.96,Default,Yukino,0000,0000,0000,,Ah. That girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.96,0:07:56.36,Default,Yukino,0000,0000,0000,,She was the one this morning with Nat...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.12,0:08:00.42,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Your name is Yukino, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.42,0:08:01.50,Default,Yukino,0000,0000,0000,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.50,0:08:04.04,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'm Kobato Hanato.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.95,0:08:09.80,Default,Yukino,0000,0000,0000,,Nat.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.39,0:08:16.48,Default,Yukino,0000,0000,0000,,I think she needs you for something.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.08,0:08:18.81,Default,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, from this morning...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.81,0:08:22.59,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'm Kobato Hanato! I've come to return your handkerchief.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.47,0:08:27.51,Default,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,You washed it for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.51,0:08:30.29,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes! But I don't have an iron...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.29,0:08:32.47,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry it's a little wrinkled.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.47,0:08:33.74,Default,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.41,0:08:35.76,Default,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.93,0:08:38.96,Default,Yukino,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I'll be off now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.21,0:08:41.15,Default,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,What about pool cleaning?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.15,0:08:45.58,Default,Yukino,0000,0000,0000,,I'm actually working part time now. I'm sorry I didn't tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.03,0:08:48.80,Default,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,It's against school regulations to work, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.48,0:08:51.87,Default,Yukino,0000,0000,0000,,I know. It's just that...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.64,0:08:55.01,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Yukino!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.64,0:08:55.01,Default Alt,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Yuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.94,0:08:59.34,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry we're late!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.56,0:09:02.57,Default,Yukino,0000,0000,0000,,Nat, I'm really sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.57,0:09:03.34,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Yukino?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.13,0:09:07.35,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,That Yukino, she's working really hard right now to buy a camera.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.37,0:09:12.73,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,We'll help out with pool cleaning, so please excuse her for today!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.20,0:09:16.59,Default,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't know...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.04,0:09:22.53,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Natsuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.92,0:09:27.01,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I will help too!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.99,0:09:33.41,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It's just like Fujimoto said...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.41,0:09:37.96,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,A high class place not fit for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.96,0:09:42.92,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,You just jumped right in... You were\Nreally forward about picking her up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.92,0:09:46.21,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Picking her up? I was too forward?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.97,0:09:49.08,Default,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry to keep you waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.73,0:09:52.98,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry for suddenly picking you up!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.73,0:09:57.56,Default,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,Oh... It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.56,0:10:01.02,Default,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't feel like going home by\Nmyself anyway so I'm glad you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.98,0:10:03.47,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Thank goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.38,0:10:07.74,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,That picture...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.91,0:10:12.08,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,That girl looks like Yukino!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.75,0:10:16.29,Default,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,It's from the summer festival when we were in elementary school.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.29,0:10:18.99,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,You two look so close!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.99,0:10:21.32,Default,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,We... were very close, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.44,0:10:25.39,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,You aren't very close anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.82,0:10:30.01,Default,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,Well... Yukino keeps avoiding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.68,0:10:35.60,Default,Yukino,0000,0000,0000,,Nat, good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.60,0:10:37.64,Default,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning, Yukino!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.64,0:10:39.53,Default,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,Your shirt's gotten untucked in the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.71,0:10:42.29,Default,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,I'll fix it for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.71,0:10:47.28,Default,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,Before, we used to walk to school together every morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.78,0:10:50.44,Default,Yukino,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry we're late!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.44,0:10:52.75,Default,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,Yukino, you have terrible bed hair!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.75,0:10:55.29,Default,Yukino,0000,0000,0000,,Seriously? Oh no! Wait just a sec, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.46,0:10:59.21,Default,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,What? Hurry back!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.75,0:11:02.46,Default,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder when it started...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.46,0:11:06.18,Default,Yukino,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry Nat, I overslept! Go ahead without me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.18,0:11:07.63,Default,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.76,0:11:11.20,Default,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,After we got into high school, slowly...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.24,0:11:13.22,Default,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,And then--
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.01,0:11:16.10,Default,Yukino,0000,0000,0000,,So pretty...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.16,0:11:22.28,Default,Yukino,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry Nat, you can go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.67,0:11:24.02,Default,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.14,0:11:30.91,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Yukino, if you're interested in photography, join our club!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.67,0:11:34.01,Default,Yukino,0000,0000,0000,,But I'm not good enough for the club yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.01,0:11:35.60,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Don't say that!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.60,0:11:37.14,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Even if you just come and learn with us...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.14,0:11:38.03,Default,Yukino,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.03,0:11:39.67,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Come on, it's totally okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.77,0:11:45.14,Default,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,Recently, we've been completely separate from each other...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.16,0:11:54.63,Default,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,I don't even know what's on her mind anymore...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.26,0:12:19.47,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I want to help Natsuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.47,0:12:20.96,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,How?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.96,0:12:22.51,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.78,0:12:26.44,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,You don't know?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.65,0:12:31.34,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Well, for now I'll go visit Yukino.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.19,0:12:39.65,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you. It looks like we'll make it on time for the festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.65,0:12:40.52,Default,Yukino,0000,0000,0000,,No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.58,0:12:49.06,Default,Yukino,0000,0000,0000,,Take whichever one you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.06,0:12:52.00,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry for bothering you at work.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.00,0:12:55.29,Default,Yukino,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry about it, I'm all finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.29,0:12:57.16,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.16,0:13:02.02,Default,Yukino,0000,0000,0000,,I've finally saved up some money and I can go buy a camera at the sale tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.02,0:13:04.93,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,What about the camera you were using yesterday?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.93,0:13:05.65,Default,Yukino,0000,0000,0000,,Yesterday?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.58,0:13:09.88,Default,Yukino,0000,0000,0000,,Oh! That was a friend's.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.88,0:13:11.64,Default,Yukino,0000,0000,0000,,But I've really wanted to get one of my own,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.64,0:13:13.14,Default,Yukino,0000,0000,0000,,so I've been working for a long time to save up money.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.14,0:13:15.34,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,You're amazing, Yukino!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.34,0:13:19.94,Default,Yukino,0000,0000,0000,,It's a hobby I started with just a cell phone camera, but I've really fallen in love with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.94,0:13:22.69,Default,Yukino,0000,0000,0000,,And I'm really close with the girls in the Photography Club too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.69,0:13:25.03,Default,Yukino,0000,0000,0000,,We always have so much to talk about!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.03,0:13:26.20,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,What about Natsuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.24,0:13:30.89,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Do you not... talk to Natsuki anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.65,0:13:35.52,Default,Yukino,0000,0000,0000,,Nat's a friend from a long time ago...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.15,0:13:40.73,Default,Yukino,0000,0000,0000,,Matching phones!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.73,0:13:41.92,Default,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.92,0:13:43.78,Default,Yukino,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, let's go buy a phone charm!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.78,0:13:45.47,Default,Yukino,0000,0000,0000,,Let's get matching ones!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.47,0:13:48.72,Default,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,If our charms match too, we won't be able to tell our phones apart!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.30,0:13:50.47,Default,Yukino,0000,0000,0000,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.78,0:13:54.60,Default,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going to get this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.60,0:13:56.22,Default,Yukino,0000,0000,0000,,Then I'll get this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.76,0:13:58.39,Default,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,A watermelon for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.39,0:14:00.44,Default,Yukino,0000,0000,0000,,And a snowman for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.87,0:14:04.01,Default,Girls,0000,0000,0000,,Yours is cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.70,0:14:06.00,Default,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,Let's switch?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.00,0:14:07.10,Default,Yukino,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.84,0:14:10.32,Default,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,I'll treasure it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.32,0:14:12.28,Default,Yukino,0000,0000,0000,,Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.16,0:14:20.75,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Are you no longer close with Natsuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.36,0:14:24.17,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Do you two hate each other now?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.43,0:14:25.95,Default,Yukino,0000,0000,0000,,Never!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.95,0:14:28.43,Default,Yukino,0000,0000,0000,,I could never hate Nat!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.16,0:14:31.24,Default,Yukino,0000,0000,0000,,After all, she's my idol.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.74,0:14:35.41,Default,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,Stop it! It's embarrassing!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.83,0:14:38.42,Default,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,Let's take one together.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.42,0:14:39.41,Default,Yukino,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.08,0:14:42.86,Default,Girls,0000,0000,0000,,Cheese!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.23,0:14:46.22,Default,Yukino,0000,0000,0000,,Let me take one of you next time, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.22,0:14:49.32,Default,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe when you get better at taking pictures!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.32,0:14:50.28,Default,Yukino,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.66,0:15:11.49,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Both Natsuki and Yukino really want to stay friends...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.49,0:15:13.98,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder why they can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.98,0:15:15.60,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Who knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.60,0:15:19.72,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,If they themselves don't know, there's no way others would be able to figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.04,0:15:23.88,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But... I want to do something for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.84,0:15:32.29,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Excuse me, where's the camera sale?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.29,0:15:33.49,Default,Lady,0000,0000,0000,,Is this the one you're talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.49,0:15:34.41,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.74,0:15:39.64,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,When you get back, let's try it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.64,0:15:41.05,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,That's a really nice one!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.73,0:15:45.07,Default,Yukino,0000,0000,0000,,Nat!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.07,0:15:46.36,Default,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,Are you here shopping?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.36,0:15:47.65,Default,Yukino,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.81,0:15:50.47,Default,Yukino,0000,0000,0000,,I bought a single lens reflex camera.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.45,0:15:53.21,Default,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.82,0:15:59.71,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Yukino worked really hard at her part time job to buy a good camera.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.71,0:16:03.18,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah! It's such a good model that even the rest of us in the Photography Club are jealous.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.18,0:16:05.81,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Yukino, you really should join the Photography Club!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.81,0:16:07.77,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, you should!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.77,0:16:10.31,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,To commemorate your new single lens camera!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.31,0:16:13.06,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, you were finally able to buy your dream camera!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.06,0:16:15.69,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,I know! Let's go to a photography convention!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.69,0:16:18.81,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,You're so talented, Yukino! I'm sure you'd be able to get some good shots!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.81,0:16:19.99,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, totally!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.99,0:16:20.56,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.56,0:16:21.33,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.33,0:16:22.72,Default,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,You guys are so stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.58,0:16:30.65,Default,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,Even photographs that just mimic an advertisement can be seen as pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.65,0:16:32.75,Default,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,So a lot of people are mistaken about good photography.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.60,0:16:36.21,Default,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,Yukino, are you sure you aren't one of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.57,0:16:40.93,Default,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,Even though you're an amateur with no talent, you pretend you're a pro. You're pathetic!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.46,0:16:48.90,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yukino!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.90,0:16:50.10,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Natsuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.67,0:17:03.85,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yukino?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.98,0:17:17.36,Default,Yukino,0000,0000,0000,,I think it'd be nice if I had talent too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.36,0:17:20.94,Default,Yukino,0000,0000,0000,,I just... like photography and cameras. That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.90,0:17:27.05,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Um... I think it's great that you were able to buy the camera you wanted so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.05,0:17:27.77,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,And--
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.77,0:17:28.55,Default,Yukino,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.94,0:17:32.63,Default,Yukino,0000,0000,0000,,Could you let me be myself for a bit?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.99,0:17:44.44,Default,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,Why... Why did I say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.94,0:17:49.89,Default,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,It's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.89,0:17:51.54,Default,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,The charm is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.54,0:17:52.38,Default,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,What happened to it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.43,0:18:00.15,Default,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,It's not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.64,0:18:06.01,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, where are you going now?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.01,0:18:09.56,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,What Natsuki said earlier just wasn't right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.56,0:18:11.53,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I just have to say something to her!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.03,0:18:13.44,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Say what?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.91,0:18:15.47,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'll say...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.47,0:18:17.86,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Whatever, things just can't go on like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.47,0:18:28.78,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.12,0:18:32.85,Default,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,The charm! The charm is missing!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.84,0:18:35.10,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'll help you look!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.91,0:18:39.71,Default,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,I've already looked there. I've looked everywhere, it's just not here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.60,0:18:42.78,Default,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.78,0:18:47.23,Default,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,I said such terrible things to Yukino, that's why it went missing!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.67,0:18:50.14,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,At any rate, l'll help you search.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.72,0:19:01.54,Default,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,What should I do? I'm... I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.19,0:19:13.43,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Natsuki...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.36,0:19:25.70,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Natsuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.57,0:19:29.97,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Here it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.50,0:19:40.91,Default,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.45,0:19:43.80,Default,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you so much, Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.85,0:19:51.87,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,You and Yukino are really still close friends, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.94,0:19:57.76,Default,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,I... think I might've been afraid of Yukino.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.88,0:20:05.68,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure that's because you were just stunned by how hardworking and driven Yukino is.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.77,0:20:13.05,Default,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,Yukino's changed, little by little, from the way she used to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.05,0:20:16.47,Default,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,Sometimes, I just feel like she's getting so far away from me,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.47,0:20:19.99,Default,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,and I was really afraid of getting left behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.78,0:20:26.32,Default,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,That's why I worked so hard at school and on my studies.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.34,0:20:33.56,Default,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,It was me who grew distant from her first.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.51,0:20:40.03,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Natsuki, may I borrow your phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.03,0:20:53.01,Default,Yukino,0000,0000,0000,,Nat.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.70,0:21:09.49,Default,Yukino,0000,0000,0000,,Nat.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.51,0:21:12.31,Default,Yukino,0000,0000,0000,,You were still holding onto it for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.66,0:21:16.07,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yukino.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.26,0:21:24.73,Default,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,Yukino. What I said earlier was terrible, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.43,0:21:28.60,Default,Yukino,0000,0000,0000,,I still have it too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.53,0:21:39.94,Default,Yukino,0000,0000,0000,,I've always been holding onto mine as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.61,0:21:42.53,Default,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,Yukino.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.25,0:21:49.40,Default,Yukino,0000,0000,0000,,I've always been holding onto mine as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.32,0:22:00.03,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Miss Sayaka, Miss Chitose,\Nyou've never fought before?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.45,0:22:05.05,Default,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,We've fought so many times I can't even count them anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.40,0:22:07.35,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.35,0:22:11.51,Default,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,We've even given each other the silent treatment many times!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.97,0:22:15.36,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, I suppose we have.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.36,0:22:18.41,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But the two of you are still so close!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.91,0:22:21.90,Default,Yukino,0000,0000,0000,,Nat! Smile!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.90,0:22:24.62,Default,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,But it's embarrassing!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.29,0:22:36.74,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,The fireworks are so pretty!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.60,0:22:39.17,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,You get 90 points today!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.17,0:22:40.50,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,You just managed to scrape through.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.81,0:22:46.13,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Fireworks are so pretty!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.13,0:22:49.10,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,We're not here for you to heal yourself at summer festivals!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.10,0:22:51.79,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Dobato, minus 200 points!!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.79,0:22:54.65,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Such pretty fireworks!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.65,0:22:56.56,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, listen when other people are speaking to you!!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.05,0:22:59.26,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,So pretty!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.20,0:01:16.00,Title Screen,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(300,0)\pos(340,90)}Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.00,0:01:23.67,Title Screen,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,500)\t(\fscy140\fscx120)\move(340,90,340,45)}Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.24,0:01:18.85,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}How do I do this again?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.14,0:01:23.44,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}The simplest things in life
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.47,0:01:27.45,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}end up being the most difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.68,0:01:30.25,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I just want to smile when I'm happy
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.52,0:01:37.59,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}and sing a song whenever I please.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.01,0:01:43.17,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I was told, "Someday, your dream will come true."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.96,0:01:47.01,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}But when exactly will that be?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.18,0:01:50.55,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I can't wait that long!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.80,0:01:53.61,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I spread my arms
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.75,0:01:56.35,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}on the count of one two three
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.60,0:02:01.60,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}and gather all the light in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.78,0:02:04.41,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}Tell me,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.42,0:02:08.00,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}isn't there something I can do?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.03,0:02:10.76,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}Even if someone hurts my feelings,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.83,0:02:13.50,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I'll keep running toward the light.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.73,0:02:20.38,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}Even if I trip, fall, and cry my eyes out, I still believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.67,0:02:24.39,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}Although it may seem silly...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.20,0:02:29.04,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I believe in tomorrow.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:16.24,0:01:18.85,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}How do I do this again?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:19.14,0:01:23.44,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}The simplest things in life
Dialogue: 1,0:01:24.47,0:01:27.45,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}end up being the most difficult.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:27.68,0:01:30.25,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}I just want to smile when I'm happy
Dialogue: 1,0:01:30.52,0:01:37.59,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}and sing a song whenever I please.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:39.01,0:01:43.17,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}I was told, "Someday, your dream will come true."
Dialogue: 1,0:01:43.96,0:01:47.01,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}But when exactly will that be?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:47.18,0:01:50.55,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}I can't wait that long!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:50.80,0:01:53.61,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}I spread my arms
Dialogue: 1,0:01:53.75,0:01:56.35,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}on the count of one two three
Dialogue: 1,0:01:56.60,0:02:01.60,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}and gather all the light in the world.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:01.78,0:02:04.41,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}Tell me,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:04.42,0:02:08.00,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}isn't there something I can do?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:08.03,0:02:10.76,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}Even if someone hurts my feelings,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:10.83,0:02:13.50,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}I'll keep running toward the light.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:13.73,0:02:20.38,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}Even if I trip, fall, and cry my eyes out, I still believe.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:20.67,0:02:24.39,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}Although it may seem silly...
Dialogue: 1,0:02:25.20,0:02:29.04,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}I believe in tomorrow.
